        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Helmut Anheier, Martin Knapp\n- Organizations: Heidelberg University, Max Weber Institute of Sociology, Center for Social Investment and Innovation\n- Places: Heidelberg, Baden-Württemberg, Germany\n- Products: Voluntas (journal)\n\nFacts:\n- In 1990, Voluntas was established with Helmut Anheier and Martin Knapp as its founding editors-in-chief.\n- Heidelberg University is a public research university in Heidelberg, Baden-Württemberg, Germany.\n- Helmut Anheier holds a chair at the Max Weber Institute of Sociology at Heidelberg University.\n- Helmut Anheier is also the Academic Director of the Center for Social Investment and Innovation at Heidelberg University.",
